        "id": "21a37e9f-ab2f-46a1-b47a-678a988a7936",
        "body": "SKI-19 local implementation and acceptance blocker update (baseline `8c88c34`).\n\nImplemented exact `@mcpfn/core`, `@mcpfn/auth`, and `@mcpfn/testing` 0.0.5 pins in the MCP and OAuth consumers, with registry integrity hashes in the frozen lockfile. Reviewed upstream PR 204 and verified published npm artifacts. Updated release-age exclusions and operations documentation. Removed `allow_eval_during_startup` from local/development/production MCP configurations and the topology renderer; every regenerated MCP config contains only `nodejs_compat`. No Zod alias/shim, SDK/Zod version change, tool contract change, or authentication code change was introduced. Development render tests now assert date and flags for all 14 outputs.\n\nVerified locally:\n- Frozen installation and McpFn adoption verification pass.\n- Focused configuration/topology tests: 25/25 pass.\n- Full unit gate: 503 package tests plus 107 script tests pass (610 total).\n- Full build: 19/19 tasks pass; full typecheck: 33/33 tasks pass.\n- Full `pnpm deploy:check` passes, including development topology dry-run of all 14 Workers with MCP included. This is bundling/render evidence, not a Cloudflare upload.\n- Real workerd via Wrangler 4.115.0 reaches ready state for both the local MCP source config and the generated in-south development MCP config. Local protected-resource discovery returns 200; unauthenticated MCP GET and POST return 401 with a Bearer challenge. The regional Worker returns 401 `WORKSPACE_ROUTING_ASSERTION_REQUIRED` for an unsigned workspace tool call. All bindings and database connections used for these checks were local simulations/disposable fixtures.\n- Changed-file Prettier checks and `git diff --check` pass.\n\nAcceptance blockers:\n1. MCP contract, official conformance, integration, and security setup fail when Skillplane passes a null owner into AuthFn 0.3.0 `createApiKey`, which calls `Array.from(input.userId)`. Reproduced on an unchanged archived baseline with McpFn 0.0.4; tracked as child SKI-20.\n2. Full security gate stops at the existing redaction analytics assertion (retrievalCount 0 versus expected 1). Reproduced on the unchanged baseline; tracked as child SKI-21.\n\nCloudflare development upload and deployed authentication smoke remain unverified. The development deploy script requires a committed clean worktree, while the retrieved Work Linear Issue 1.0.1 workflow prohibits committing or deploying before separate approval. No commit, push, PR, cloud deployment, or issue status change was performed; production is unverified and untouched. This is a blocker update, not a completion claim. Resolve the baseline test blockers and rerun the MCP gates before requesting publication/development deployment approval.\n",
